---
// Shared Beta marker for the governance action submit page's entry points
// (account menu row, home card). Same shape as the home card's "New" pill but
// outlined and muted, so a permanent label reads differently from a
// self-retiring one at a glance. The text is visible, so no aria-label.
---
<span class="beta-pill">Beta</span>

<style>
  .beta-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-left: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.4;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--muted);
    vertical-align: text-bottom;
  }
</style>
